"studies": [{"study_index": 1, "title": "Frozen shoulder: prospective clinical study with an evaluation of three 
treatment regimens", "abstract": "Forty-two patients with frozen shoulder were followed up closely for eight months. 
They were all taught pendular exercises and randomly allocated to one of four treatment groups: (a) intraarticular 
