high |
| 9 | PNF movement patterns compared to the use of conventional free exercises to improve joint ROM in chronic 
peri‐arthritis of the shoulder | INCLUDE | medium |
| 10 | Comparing effectiveness of antero‐posterior and postero‐anterior glides on shoulder range of motion in adhesive 
capsulitis—a pilot study | INCLUDE | high |
| 13 | Intraarticular corticosteroids, supervised physiotherapy, or a combination of the two in the treatment of 
adhesive capsulitis of the shoulder: a placebo‐controlled trial | INCLUDE | high |
| 14 | Efficacy and cost‐effectiveness of physiotherapy following glenohumeral joint distension for adhesive capsulitis:
a randomized trial | INCLUDE | high |
